
**Project:** Tshepe Haulage (Kimberly) | **Scheme:** 10.25.0.0/16 | **Milestone 2**


Enterprise uses private Class A 10.25.0.0/16 to allow 256 x /24 subnets.
We use /24 per VLAN for simplicity and 254 hosts per VLAN - enough for growth.

- Subnet Mask: 255.255.255.0 (/24)
- Why /24: Easy troubleshooting, VLAN isolation, DHCP management



