| 20 | GUEST | 10.25.20.0 | 255.255.255.0 | 10.25.20.1 | 10.25.20.255 | 10.25.20.2-254 | .1 - .10 |
| 30 | SERVER | 10.25.30.0 | 255.255.255.0 | 10.25.30.1 | 10.25.30.255 | 10.25.30.2-254 | .1 - .10 |
