R1 G0/0 is trunked to SW1:

- G0/0.10 -> VLAN 10 -> encapsulation dot1Q 10 -> ip 10.25.10.1/24
- G0/0.20 -> VLAN 20 -> encapsulation dot1Q 20 -> ip 10.25.20.1/24 + ACL 100 IN
- G0/0.30 -> VLAN 30 -> encapsulation dot1Q 30 -> ip 10.25.30.1/24
- G0/0.40 -> VLAN 40 -> encapsulation dot1Q 40 -> ip 10.25.40.1/24

All sub-ifs: 



- ISP Link: 203.0.113.0/30
- R1 G0/1: 203.0.113.2/30 (NAT outside)
- ISP Router: 203.0.113.1/30
- NAT: `access-list 10 permit 10.25.0.0 0.0.255.255` + `ip nat inside source list 10 interface G0/1 overload`
- Default Route: `ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 203.0.113.1`



